<title>INDIA: Delhi stocks down in mid-session.</title>
<headline>Delhi stocks down in mid-session.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delhi shares quoted lower in afternoon trade on Friday as both foreign and domestic investors adopted a cautious approach in the face of recent political developments.</p>
<p>At 12.45 p.m., the Delhi benchmark index was down 4.22 points at 879.89.</p>
